*> BUG2 : sous-totaux par région.
*> Attendu (cf. TP4.3) : EST 3470.75, NORD 5290.00, OUEST 2470.40, SUD 3235.75
*> Lancer depuis le dossier workspace :  cob seance5/tp/bug2.cob
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BUG2.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT F-VENTES ASSIGN TO "seance4/data/ventes.dat"
        ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
    SELECT F-TRIE   ASSIGN TO "seance5/tp/ventes_tri_bug2.dat"
        ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL
        FILE STATUS IS WS-FS.
    SELECT F-TRI    ASSIGN TO "sortwork".

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD F-VENTES.
01 ENR-VENTE        PIC X(27).
FD F-TRIE.
01 ENR-TRIE.
   05 V-REGION      PIC X(10).
   05 V-VENDEUR     PIC X(10).
   05 V-MONTANT     PIC 9(5)V99.
SD F-TRI.
01 ENR-TRI.
   05 T-REGION      PIC X(10).
   05 T-VENDEUR     PIC X(10).
   05 T-MONTANT     PIC 9(5)V99.

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-FS            PIC XX.
   88 FS-FIN               VALUE "10".
01 WS-REGION-PREC   PIC X(10).
01 WS-TOTAL         PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-ED            PIC Z,ZZZ,ZZ9.99.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-PRINCIPAL.
    SORT F-TRI ON ASCENDING KEY T-REGION T-VENDEUR
        USING F-VENTES GIVING F-TRIE
    OPEN INPUT F-TRIE
    READ F-TRIE
        AT END CONTINUE
    END-READ
    MOVE V-REGION TO WS-REGION-PREC
    PERFORM UNTIL FS-FIN
        IF V-REGION NOT = WS-REGION-PREC
            PERFORM 1000-SOUS-TOTAL
            MOVE V-REGION TO WS-REGION-PREC
        END-IF
        ADD V-MONTANT TO WS-TOTAL
        READ F-TRIE
            AT END CONTINUE
        END-READ
    END-PERFORM
    CLOSE F-TRIE
    STOP RUN.

1000-SOUS-TOTAL.
    MOVE WS-TOTAL TO WS-ED
    DISPLAY WS-REGION-PREC " " WS-ED.
